      "id": "claim_52a07f0f8f7a444f95d8822060359634",
      "statement": "Event projections (ironclaw_event_projections) are metadata-only read models replayed from durable events; they provide scoped, typed views of what happened to a turn or thread (ThreadTimeline, RunStatusProjection, CapabilityActivityProjection) without writing and without exposing raw inputs, outputs, or secrets.",
      "evidence": [
        {
